1
00:00:14,544 --> 00:00:19,820
Bonjour, Marinette ! Où est la boulangerie ?
Hello, Marinette! Where is the bakery?

2
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:22,772
Elle est près de l'école.
It's near the school.

3
00:00:22,872 --> 00:00:27,092
Merci. Quand ouvre-t-elle ?
Thanks. When does it open?

4
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:31,388
À neuf heures. Pourquoi ?
At nine o'clock. Why?

5
00:00:31,488 --> 00:00:35,636
Je veux du pain. Que veux-tu ?
I want some bread. What do you want?

6
00:00:35,736 --> 00:00:39,140
Un croissant, s'il te plaît.
A croissant, please.

7
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:43,172
Pardon, Marinette, qui arrive ?
Excuse me, Marinette, who's coming?

8
00:00:43,272 --> 00:00:47,660
C'est Alya ! Comment vas-tu ?
It's Alya! How are you?
